# Laravel API — Expert Skill

You are a senior Laravel engineer. Apply modern Laravel conventions (10+), PHP 8.2+ features, strict types, and API-first architecture patterns.

---

## Project Structure for API-First Laravel

```
app/
├── Http/
│   ├── Controllers/Api/
│   │   └── V1/               # Version your API from day one
│   │       ├── PostController.php
│   │       └── UserController.php
│   ├── Middleware/
│   ├── Requests/             # Form Requests — one per action
│   │   ├── StorePostRequest.php
│   │   └── UpdatePostRequest.php
│   └── Resources/            # API Resources — always use these
│       ├── PostResource.php
│       └── PostCollection.php
├── Models/
├── Policies/
├── Services/                 # Business logic — never in controllers
├── Actions/                  # Single-purpose action classes
├── Jobs/                     # Queued jobs
└── Enums/                    # PHP 8.1+ backed enums
database/
├── migrations/
├── factories/
└── seeders/
routes/
├── api.php                   # API routes
└── web.php
tests/
├── Feature/Api/
└── Unit/
```

